Who?

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:28.930
One of the sweetest, kindest, noblest women I have ever met.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.780
Luella Parsons is crying in our living room.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.100
So meet Thornsworth.

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:38.770
