00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:51.240
why would she go to all the trouble of coming here?

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:53.900
Margaret, simply because nobody's ever said no to her before,

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:56.030
and she can't stand it.

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:59.120
Isn't it just possible that you have misjudged her?

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:00.000
Yeah, Uncle.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:06.360
Bob you don't understand us movie people you know you may be talking to the new

