Montgomery Clift well apparently Philippa's put on quite a performance

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:17.580
for you too Bob she's a very sweet simple person even offered to help me

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:24.060
peel my potatoes no minks or nylon just let me show you what a kind simple sweet

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:29.380
person she is excuse me Monty

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:44.370
forgive me it's kind of you to call on Margaret and Chuck well I wanted your lovely family to

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:49.530
get to know the real me yes I can hardly wait for that myself I was telling Bob how you offered

00:18:49.530 --> 00:18:54.690
to help me peel the potatoes and get me a screen test well oh underneath all this glamour and

00:18:54.690 --> 00:19:00.000
glitter you really are a kind sweet person aren't you I try to do the best I I know how

