00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:18.860
- You thinker!

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:21.820
You mean I've wasted an Academy performance on this,

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:23.410
this dull group?

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:25.330
- Oh, we all thought it was the real you.

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:27.370
- I'll show you who the real me is.

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:29.540
You haven't heard the last of this yet.

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:33.490
Miss Farnsworth, what about my screen task?

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:35.090
Oh, get out of my way, you...

00:19:35.090 --> 00:19:36.350
You juvenile delinquent!

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:43.970
You gonna peel the potatoes?

00:19:53.780 --> 00:19:57.630
25 years at a studio and fired.

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:00.000
I had no choice.

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:05.410
the leap insisted on it you know all this happened just because i wouldn't

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:06.950
photograph

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:10.320
she's used to getting her own way

