she's about to be photographed by one of the world's

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:30.000
foremost genius

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:35.940
keeping him so long. Mr. Collins is projecting himself into a creative mood.

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:41.500
Oh? How does he do that? Oh, by listening to Mozart and smoking his Turkish water pipe.

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:46.900
Oh, really? Oh, I find that fascinating. He said you should make yourself comfortable.

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:51.490
Oh, I hear him coming. You won't know him. He's a completely different man when he's creating.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:54.390
Oh, well, I understand. It's all right.

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:03.060
If you need me, sir.

