Hold it, please.

00:22:43.560 --> 00:22:44.910
Just hold it.

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:46.660
Hold it, please.

00:22:47.060 --> 00:22:47.700
That is it.

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:48.540
Hold it, hold it.

00:22:51.680 --> 00:22:55.120
As far as worth.

